<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alexs Seite-Witze</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --accent-color: #0d6efd;
            --text-main: #212529;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        .col-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .col-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .col-section {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            min-height: 200px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: #333;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .navbar-brand, .nav-item {
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    .joke-card {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid #eee !important;
      border-radius: 12px !important;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
    }

    .joke-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark mb-4 shadow">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <a onclick="window.location.href='/'" class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="#">Alexs Seite</a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#nav01">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>

                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="nav01">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0">
                        <li onclick="window.location.href='/Witze'" class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#">Witze</a></li>
                        <li onclick="window.location.href='/Umfrage'" class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#">Umfrage</a></li>
                    </ul>
                    <form class="d-flex" role="search">
                        <input class="form-control me-2 rounded-pill" type="search" placeholder="Suchen...">
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="col-container">
      <section class="col-section">
        <div class="text-center">
        </div>

        <div class="card joke-card">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary">Der Uhu</h5>
            <p class="card-text">Was sitzt auf einem Baum und winkt?<br><strong>Ein Huhu</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card joke-card">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary">Chinesisch</h5>
            <p class="card-text">Wie heißt der Chinesische Sexminister?<br><strong>Schwing dein Ding.</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card joke-card">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary">Chuck Norris</h5>
            <p class="card-text">Auf welcher seite fährt Chuck Norris in England?<br><strong>Auf der Rechten seite</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card joke-card">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary">Home Office</h5>
            <p class="card-text">Zu Hause arbeiten ist scheiße.<br><strong>Andreas (28), Feuerwehrmann</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card joke-card">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary">Anke</h5>
            <p class="card-text">Alle Kinder spenden für Behinderte.<br><strong>Nur nicht Anke sie sagt danke</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>
            </section>

            <section class="col-section">
                <div class="card joke-card overflow-hidden">
                    <img src="" class="card-img-top img-fluid" alt="Lustiges Bild">
                </div>
                <div id="carouselExample" class="carousel slide">
                <div class="carousel-inner">
                    <div class="carousel-item active">
                    <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.buzzfeed.de%2Fbilder%2F2022%2F09%2F06%2F91788162%2F29801199-was-steht-auf-dem-grabstein-des-schornsteinfegers-er-kehrt-nie-wieder-Pj7d.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=75a0bd3bb4de4f7e8633c842cec7f89a38ca5e3a3faad6afc19232f62464d043" class="d-block w-100" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="carousel-item">
                    <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.buzzfeed.de%2Fbilder%2F2022%2F09%2F06%2F91788162%2F29801409-wie-nennt-man-einen-polizisten-ohne-haare-galtz-cop-Ru7d.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=c064de97677e7e5319a9f59a687cd93258adac77cac69813989370aafec1a0f1" class="d-block w-100" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="carousel-item">
                    <img src="https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.buzzfeed.de%2Fbilder%2F2022%2F09%2F06%2F91788162%2F29801899-wie-nennt-man-einen-cowboy-ohne-pferd-einen-sattelschlepper-NUPH.jpg&f=1&nofb=1&ipt=83f76b81809f777687427300687545cd1d6bed097a8de14c76373f913e83f575#" class="d-block w-100" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExample" data-bs-slide="prev">
                    <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
                </button>
                <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#carouselExample" data-bs-slide="next">
                    <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
                </button>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>